{
	"SchemaName": "CoreBio_ClaimLevel",
	"HeaderRow": 1,
	"//": [
		"CoreBio 'Claim Level File' sheet. Mapping per AveragesTable_AllAccounts_Field Mapping_V1.20.xlsx,",
		"ClaimLevelFactTable, column 'CoreBio'.",
		"Each column is a source header; where it is not already a COMMON alias, Aliases names the COMMON",
		"column it feeds - a lab-only alias group, so ClaimLevel.schema.json is unchanged for other labs.",
		"At claim level DenialCode is the sheet's 'Denial Code' (V1.20). It is declared so it wins over",
		"'Claim Level Denial Code', which the COMMON aliases list first; 'Claim Level Denial Code' still",
		"fills the COMMON column of that name.",
		"ICDCode is pinned to 'Claim ICD List' with a composite: 'Claim Level ICD' is listed first in the",
		"COMMON ICDCode aliases, and the composite also leaves it unconsumed so it is appended raw.",
		"InsuranceBalance is 'Total Ins Balance' here (V1.20); 'Charge Balance Due Ins' is appended raw.",
		"'Facility Name' is a COMMON ClinicName alias, so it fills ClinicName and is kept raw for Facility.",
		"'LIS Panel' feeds the COMMON 'Panel Name LIS' column.",
		"'CPT X MOD X UNITS' feeds 'CPT Code X Units X Modifier Orginal'; the COMMON 'CPT Code X Units X",
		"Modifier' is rebuilt from the line level after export (EnrichClaimLevelWithLineLevelCptSummary).",
		"'Charge Last Bill Date' reaches 'Last Billed Date' through the COMMON alias; it deliberately has NO",
		"alias here (the COMMON FirstBilledDate aliases include 'Last billed date').",
		"'Total Balance' is not read: the COMMON column is calculated (Insurance + Patient Balance)."
	],
	"Columns": [
		{ "Name": "Charge Claim ID", "Aliases": [ "ClaimID" ], "Required": true, "DataType": "string" },
